 firms.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"PYNGYN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"name\":\"Integrations | PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"Connect Workspace with the tools your team uses every day, so status stays current in your clients' Clientspace automatically.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Integrations\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\"}]},{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations#itemlist\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN integrations\",\"itemListOrder\":\"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending\",\"numberOfItems\":26,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Slack\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Turn requests and action items from Slack into trackable tasks, and push status back.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Gmail\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Turn emails into tasks without leaving your inbox, and keep status in sync.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"QuickBooks\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Sync clients, invoices, and time entries so billable work flows into your books, and invoice status appears in the client's Clientspace automatically.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Zoho Books\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Sync clients, invoices, and payments with Zoho Books so billable work stays reconciled, and invoice status appears in the client's Clientspace automatically.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Computax\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Keep return filings and computation status tied to the underlying engagement, so your team and the client both see where a filing stands.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Google Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Sync deadlines and client milestones so timelines live where your firm plans the day, and upcoming sessions appear automatically in the client's Clientspace.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Xero\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Push approved time and expenses to Xero and keep invoicing in sync with delivered work, visible to the client in Clientspace as soon as it's approved.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"name\":\"Microsoft Teams\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Bring conversations into actionable items and post status to your channels.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"name\":\"Outlook\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Turn emails into work and sync meetings and deadlines to your plan.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"name\":\"Google Drive\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Attach Drive files to tasks and keep work and docs connected.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":11,\"name\":\"Dropbox\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Attach Dropbox files to tasks and automate uploads with rules.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":12,\"name\":\"DocuSign\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Send engagement letters and approvals for e-signature. Status tracks against the matter in Workspace and updates the client's Clientspace the moment it's signed.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":13,\"name\":\"Zoom\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Make meetings actionable with tasks and searchable transcripts.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":14,\"name\":\"Figma\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Share design work with live Figma embeds inside your tasks.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":15,\"name\":\"Salesforce\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Streamline collaboration across the sales cycle and sync key records.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":16,\"name\":\"HubSpot\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"View deals and campaign info in tasks and automate updates.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":17,\"name\":\"Stripe\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Bill clients and collect retainer and invoice payments, with status synced back to the engagement.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":18,\"name\":\"Zapier\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Connect PYNGYN to thousands of apps and automate repetitive work.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":19,\"name\":\"n8n\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Self-host or cloud, wire PYNGYN into 400+ apps with branching workflows, custom code, and webhooks. Built for teams that want to own their automations.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":20,\"name\":\"Make\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Build visual automations between PYNGYN and the tools you use.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":21,\"name\":\"Google Sheets\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Sync project data to Sheets and build custom reports.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":22,\"name\":\"Power BI\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Bring your team's project data to life with live dashboards.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":23,\"name\":\"Tableau\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Explore and share real-time analytics from your project data.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":24,\"name\":\"Webhooks\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Trigger your own services on any event with outgoing webhooks.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":25,\"name\":\"Google Docs\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Add context from Docs right into the flow of your work.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":26,\"name\":\"Calendly\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\",\"description\":\"Turn booked meetings into scheduled work automatically.\"}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 bo