\"Sync deadlines and client milestones so timelines live where your firm plans the day, and upcoming sessions appear automatically in the client's Clientspace.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":7,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Xero\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Push approved time and expenses to Xero and keep invoicing in sync with delivered work, visible to the client in Clientspace as soon as it's approved.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":8,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Microsoft Teams\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Bring conversations into actionable items and post status to your channels.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":9,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Outlook\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Turn emails into work and sync meetings and deadlines to your plan.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":10,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Google Drive\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Attach Drive files to tasks and keep work and docs connected.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":11,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dropbox\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Attach Dropbox files to tasks and automate uploads with rules.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":12,\\\"name\\\":\\\"DocuSign\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Send engagement letters and approvals for e-signature. Status tracks against the matter in Workspace and updates the client's Clientspace the moment it's signed.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":13,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Zoom\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Make meetings actionable with tasks and searchable transcripts.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":14,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Figma\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Share design work with live Figma embeds inside your tasks.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":15,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Salesforce\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Streamline collaboration across the sales cycle and sync key records.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":16,\\\"name\\\":\\\"HubSpot\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"View deals and campaign info in tasks and automate updates.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":17,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Stripe\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Bill clients and collect retainer and invoice payments, with status synced back to the engagement.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":18,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Zapier\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Connect PYNGYN to thousands of apps and automate repetitive work.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":19,\\\"name\\\":\\\"n8n\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Self-host or cloud, wire PYNGYN into 400+ apps with branching workflows, custom code, and webhooks. Built for teams that want to own their automations.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":20,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Make\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Build visual automations between PYNGYN and the tools you use.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":21,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Google Sheets\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Sync project data to Sheets and build custom reports.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":22,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Power BI\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/integrations\\\",\\\"descriptio